!============ LOW TEMPERATURE CHEMISTRY FOR MCH OXIDATION ===========

!  CHECK THE NEED TO INCLUDE CYCLOHEXENE LOW T CHEMISTRY
!  CHECK THE NEED TO INCLUDE FURTHER REACTIONS OF METHYL CYCLOHEXENE(MCHE) AND CYCLIC ETHERS
